  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Smt. Sushma Devi vs State Of U.P. on 19 April, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:68081 Court No. - 88 Case :- Application U/S 482 No. - 40205 of 2023 Applicant :- Smt. Sushma Devi Opposite Party :- State of U.P. Counsel for Applicant :- Himadari Batra,Sr. Advocate,Vivek Mishra Counsel for Opposite Party :- G.A. Hon'ble Vikram D. Chauhan,J. 1.",
    "facts": "whereby the application of the applicant for release of material seized by the Police in Pursuance to the registration of Criminal Case No-122/2023 registered under sections 420, 467, 468, 471, 272, 273 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860, section 59 of Food Safety Standard Act 2006, section 63, 65, 68 of the Copyright Act, 1957, section 103 & 104 of the Trade Mark Act, 1999 registered at Police Station-Rajapur, Chitrakoot is rejected.",
    "arguments": "4. Learned AGA submits that he would have no objection in respect of products which have been found to be safe and in respect of products which have been found to be substandard, may be released subject to the condition that products, food items which have been found to be substandard, shall not be sold in the market except after complying with the standard prescribed Smt. Sushma Devi vs State Of U.P. on 19 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/128056202/ 2 and subject to the satisfaction of the Food Safety Authority. 5."
  },
